# Credit Delinquency Analysis

## Project Overview
An exploratory data analysis project focused on understanding customer payment behavior and identifying patterns associated with credit delinquency.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Power Query
- PivotTables and PivotCharts

## Work Completed
- Cleaned and prepared customer data.
- Explored credit utilization, missed payments, and delinquency.
- Created PivotTables and charts to summarize the data.
- Documented findings and recommendations in reports.

## Project Files
- Excel workbook containing the analysis.
- PDF reports documenting the findings.

## Objective
To understand patterns in customer delinquency and present insights that may support credit-risk assessment.

